WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.375
- All right, we have
reached the end of the hour,

00:00:02.375 --> 00:00:04.200
but let's squeeze in one more great story.

00:00:04.200 --> 00:00:05.398
This is what I'm liking.

00:00:05.398 --> 00:00:08.906
(rock music)
(audience cheering)

00:00:08.906 --> 00:00:11.760
The father-daughter dance is
a highlight at most weddings.

00:00:11.760 --> 00:00:14.310
In California, a bride
and her dad used old video

00:00:14.310 --> 00:00:15.960
to make the moment even more touching.

00:00:15.960 --> 00:00:17.014
Take a look.

00:00:17.014 --> 00:00:19.597
(gentle music)

00:00:30.687 --> 00:00:31.863
Oh man.

00:00:31.863 --> 00:00:32.700
So sweet.

00:00:32.700 --> 00:00:33.687
The wedding was two years ago,

00:00:33.687 --> 00:00:36.060
but the bride recently
posted it as a tribute

00:00:36.060 --> 00:00:38.220
to her dad on his birthday
and it took off from there,

00:00:38.220 --> 00:00:39.720
'cause it's the sweetest thing ever.

00:00:39.720 --> 00:00:40.770
Let's get them in here.

00:00:40.770 --> 00:00:44.943
Say hi to Rhiannon and Andy
watching on NBC Los Angeles.

00:00:44.943 --> 00:00:45.776
(audience cheering)

00:00:45.776 --> 00:00:47.166
Hi.

00:00:47.166 --> 00:00:48.510
- Hi.

00:00:48.510 --> 00:00:50.010
- Oh my gosh.

00:00:50.010 --> 00:00:53.970
So whose idea was it to do the
video behind y'all dancing?

00:00:53.970 --> 00:00:55.830
- We would love to take credit for it,

00:00:55.830 --> 00:00:58.710
but it was 100% my mom's idea.

00:00:58.710 --> 00:01:01.140
Long before I ever got engaged

00:01:01.140 --> 00:01:03.120
or had met my husband even

00:01:03.120 --> 00:01:05.527
she was like, "When you get married

00:01:05.527 --> 00:01:08.857
"I'm gonna have that father-daughter
dance playing the video

00:01:08.857 --> 00:01:10.620
"of you guys when you were little."

00:01:10.620 --> 00:01:11.910
And she's an event planner

00:01:11.910 --> 00:01:15.150
so she kind of stored it
away in the back of her mind.

00:01:15.150 --> 00:01:17.503
And so, when the time
came, we dug out the video

00:01:17.503 --> 00:01:19.710
and we kind of put it together.

00:01:19.710 --> 00:01:22.320
We kept it as a surprise
from all of our guests.

00:01:22.320 --> 00:01:25.530
So, that night was just
so full of emotion.

00:01:25.530 --> 00:01:28.680
We were obviously emotional
and crying the whole time,

00:01:28.680 --> 00:01:31.140
and really just the whole
room was crying with us.

00:01:31.140 --> 00:01:33.660
So, she took a really special memory

00:01:33.660 --> 00:01:35.520
and made it so much more special.

00:01:35.520 --> 00:01:38.709
- Yeah, if anyone wasn't
crying, they have no soul.

00:01:38.709 --> 00:01:41.130
That was so beautiful.

00:01:41.130 --> 00:01:42.420
And it's especially to shock people

00:01:42.420 --> 00:01:43.680
that like, they don't know it's coming.

00:01:43.680 --> 00:01:45.030
Oh my gosh.

00:01:45.030 --> 00:01:49.110
So, Andy do you remember making
the video the first time?

00:01:49.110 --> 00:01:51.802
- Well, right now, Kelly,
we are actually in the room

00:01:51.802 --> 00:01:54.090
that we made the video.

00:01:54.090 --> 00:01:55.890
- Oh, y'all are like a country song.

00:01:55.890 --> 00:01:57.311
Okay, this is like.

00:01:57.311 --> 00:02:00.750
- This has been our house
for the last 40 years

00:02:00.750 --> 00:02:03.030
and every time I walk in this room,

00:02:03.030 --> 00:02:05.370
I remember making that video.

00:02:05.370 --> 00:02:07.110
Yeah, it was a very special evening.

00:02:07.110 --> 00:02:10.140
I was on my way overseas for a week,

00:02:10.140 --> 00:02:14.010
and we really had no
videos of Rhiannon and I,

00:02:14.010 --> 00:02:16.087
and my wife says, "We gotta
put something on film.

00:02:16.087 --> 00:02:17.490
"We gotta get something."

00:02:17.490 --> 00:02:19.800
So, Gaston was playing,

00:02:19.800 --> 00:02:22.200
so we picked up and I was
twirling her around the room

00:02:22.200 --> 00:02:24.210
to the Gaston video first.

00:02:24.210 --> 00:02:27.090
And then my wife, she fast forwarded

00:02:27.090 --> 00:02:29.280
to "Tale as Old as Time"

00:02:29.280 --> 00:02:31.620
and as soon as that came on,

00:02:31.620 --> 00:02:35.460
Rhiannon slapped her head
right against mine like this

00:02:35.460 --> 00:02:39.390
and we went into this
magical moment of a dance

00:02:39.390 --> 00:02:42.490
that I'll never forget as long as I live.

00:02:42.490 --> 00:02:43.567
- Okay.

00:02:43.567 --> 00:02:46.567
(audience clapping)

00:02:48.082 --> 00:02:51.120
I wasn't even at the
wedding and I'm crying.

00:02:51.120 --> 00:02:53.870
That is so you're the greatest dad.

00:02:53.870 --> 00:02:54.703
Oh my God.

00:02:54.703 --> 00:02:57.000
And your wife and your mom is so cool.

00:02:57.000 --> 00:02:57.900
Everybody, I'm good.

00:02:57.900 --> 00:02:59.175
Okay.

00:02:59.175 --> 00:03:01.470
Thank you so much Rhiannon
for sharing that video.

00:03:01.470 --> 00:03:02.820
Thank you, Andy, for joining us.

00:03:02.820 --> 00:03:05.010
That was so super special.

00:03:05.010 --> 00:03:07.271
I'm liking your post right now, all right.

00:03:07.271 --> 00:03:08.559
(heart dings)

00:03:08.559 --> 00:03:09.858
- [Rhiannon] Thank you.
- [Andy] Thank you.

00:03:09.858 --> 00:03:10.691
- Thank you, Kelly.

00:03:10.691 --> 00:03:11.524
- And that's not all, actually.

00:03:11.524 --> 00:03:13.020
Our season long partner, Pilot Pen,

00:03:13.020 --> 00:03:14.730
makers of FriXion, the go-to erasable pen

00:03:14.730 --> 00:03:16.050
of "The Kelly Clarkson Show"

00:03:16.050 --> 00:03:18.900
want to celebrate amazing
families just like yours.

00:03:18.900 --> 00:03:20.820
I'm still trying not to cry.

00:03:20.820 --> 00:03:22.891
So they're gonna give you $1,000.

00:03:22.891 --> 00:03:25.891
(audience cheering)

00:03:26.863 --> 00:03:28.620
Ah, y'all got me.

00:03:28.620 --> 00:03:29.490
Okay.

00:03:29.490 --> 00:03:30.603
Thank you guys so much.
- Thank you so much, Kelly.

00:03:30.603 --> 00:03:31.830
- Your beautiful family

00:03:31.830 --> 00:03:33.450
and thank you to all our guests this hour.

00:03:33.450 --> 00:03:36.179
Meg Ryan, David Duchovny, Cat Graham,

00:03:36.179 --> 00:03:37.890
Lou, Sophia, and Daniel.

00:03:37.890 --> 00:03:38.723
Y'all have a great day

00:03:38.723 --> 00:03:40.470
and if it's not, try and change it.

